amid:
prep. See Amidst.
prep. In the midst or middle of; surrounded or encompassed by;
   among.

anybody:
n. Any one out of an indefinite number of persons; anyone;
   any person.
n. A person of consideration or standing.

attractive:
a. pleasing to the eye or mind especially through beauty or charm
s. having power to arouse interest
a. having the properties of a magnet; the ability to draw or pull;

disperse:
v. to cause to separate and go in different directions
v. move away from each other; 
v. separate (light) into spectral rays

forfeiture:
n something that is lost or surrendered as a penalty; 
n a penalty for a fault or mistake that involves losing or giving up something
n the act of losing or surrendering something as a penalty for a mistake or fault or failure to perform etc.

frequent:
v. be a regular or frequent visitor to a certain place
a. coming at short intervals or habitually
s. frequently encountered;

haloed:
imp. & p. p. of Halo
a. Surrounded with a halo; invested with an ideal glory;
   glorified.

impassible:
a. Incapable of suffering; inaccessible to harm or pain;
   not to be touched or moved to passion or sympathy; unfeeling, or not
   showing feeling; without sensation.

inasmuch:
adv. In like degree; in like manner; seeing that;
   considering that; since; -- followed by as. See In as much as, under
   In, prep.

inferno:
n any place of pain and turmoil; 
n a very intense and uncontrolled fire
n (Christianity) the abode of Satan and the forces of evil; where sinners suffer eternal punishment

inflexible:
a. incapable of change
a. resistant to being bent; 
s. incapable of adapting or changing to meet circumstances

insufferably:
adv. In a manner or to a degree beyond endurance;
   intolerably; as, a blaze insufferably bright; a person insufferably
   proud.

multivocal:
a. Signifying many different things; of manifold meaning;
   equivocal.
n. A multivocal word.

musing:
n a calm, lengthy, intent consideration
v reflect deeply on a subject
s deeply or seriously thoughtful;

once:
r. on one occasion
r. as soon as
r. at a previous time;

perversion:
n. a curve that reverses the direction of something
n. an aberrant sexual practice; 
n. the action of perverting something (turning it to a wrong use)

satinwood:
n. West Indian tree with smooth lustrous and slightly oily wood
n. hard yellowish wood of a satinwood tree having a satiny luster; used for fine cabinetwork and tools
n. East Indian tree with valuable hard lustrous yellowish wood;

serviceable:
a. ready for service or able to give long service
s. capable of being put to good use
s. intended or able to serve a purpose without elaboration;

squamous:
Covered with, or consisting of, scales; resembling a scale;
   scaly; as, the squamose cones of the pine; squamous epithelial cells;
   the squamous portion of the temporal bone, which is so called from a
   fancied resemblance to a scale.
 Of or pertaining to the squamosal bone; squamosal.

voluntariness:
n. The quality or state of being voluntary;
   spontaneousness; specifically, the quality or state of being free in
   the exercise of one's will.
